WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
FortiX unifies API gateway protection with controlled resilience verification.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Start on the Dashboard to confirm active workspace scope and gateway health.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
PROTECT: Register routes in Protected APIs or API Studio and enforce WAF, SSRF, and rate limits.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
BREAK & OBSERVE: Run bounded latency, HTTP 5xx, or burst experiments while capturing live telemetry.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
PROVE & IMPROVE: Inspect deterministic PASS, FAIL, and INCONCLUSIVE verdicts in Verifications.
